Z||000000||DXR_DAD||09-25-2001||11:25 PM||||This comes from another thread, just questions????<P>Do some of you just get together just because??<P>Do you just meet at the Jack In The Box down the street??<P>I know some of you do this type of thing and I think in kinda fun!!!<P>What about those Bar-b-Q's at someones house?? and just have some Fierons over.<P>Cruz down the main street in town on a Sat.?<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||5
Z||000001||Cheever3000||09-25-2001||11:37 PM||||I wish.<BR>I still haven't met Htown86GT, and he lives somewhere very close to me.  Goldiron is near too.  I met FieroMike & FreakySix once, haven't got back together since.  Is it my cologne?  It's called "Eaux de Crankcase" or something like that.<P>I still need another email from the guy who was going to show me about taking Fiero doors apart.  After my hard drive crashed I no longer have his email.  But he said he lives near First Colony Mall, which is very close.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Oreif||09-26-2001||12:41 AM||||Usually we just get together somewhere. Right before our Fierorama I had a B-B-Q with Gargoyle, Haze, Leadfoot, Coyote, and Monkeyman. It was a very good evening. Now it's getting a little too cold at night. HMM.... maybe a Bon-Fire night would be interesting.<BR>Recently we were getting together at my house to work on Fiero's. Next week a few are getting together to go down to Twin Lakes for a "Parts Run".<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||3
